                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                           <td>The HIV-1 RNA viral load is detectable at 47,163 copies/mL, which is within the quantifiable range but indicates active viral replication. This suggests ongoing HIV infection and the need for clinical correlation regarding antiretroviral therapy status and immune function monitoring.</td>
